# Committed intentionally — this file must only ever hold non-secret, fixed
# routing config. Every real secret (Mapbox token, Google Maps key, S3/Tolgee
# URLs, etc.) belongs in Replit's Secrets pane (or the deploy environment),
# never in a file Vite loads, since VITE_-prefixed values are baked into the
# public client bundle at build time.
#
# /v2api is the prefix v2-gateway strips before forwarding to v2-backend —
# see v2-gateway/src/index.ts. This is the same value in dev and production
# because both are served through that same single-origin gateway.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=/v2api
